Schedule:Compact,
    Sliding_Doors_Ventilation_Availability_SCH,  !- Name
    Fraction,                !- Schedule Type Limits Name
    Through: 12/31,          !- Field 1
    For: WinterDesignDay SummerDesignDay,  !- Field 2
    Until: 24:00,            !- Field 3
    0,                      !- Field 4
    For: Allotherdays,       !- Field 5
    Until: 6:00,             !- Field 6
    0,                      !- Field 7
    Until: 22:00,            !- Field 8
    1,                      !- Field 9
    Until: 24:00,            !- Field 10
    0;                      !- Field 11

! ================================================================
! RL RESEARCH MODIFICATION - IDEAL LOADS REPLACEMENT
! Detailed HVAC, plant, service hot water, PV/transformer, and EMS
! objects were removed. Geometry, envelope, internal gains,
! infiltration, schedules, thermostats, and zone multipliers remain.
! Cooling/heating results below are thermal loads, not electricity.
! Convert cooling load to electricity using an explicitly stated COP.
! ================================================================

  ZoneHVAC:IdealLoadsAirSystem,
